	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Hodie, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>14. videl<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>icet apri<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>lis, meis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>mercatori<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>bus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>l<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ite<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>rę <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>s<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>u<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nt a<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ll<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>atę ex <placeName ref="l834">I<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>talia</placeName>, qu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ib<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>us i<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ndi<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>c<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>atu<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>r pa<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pam t<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>o<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tius papatu<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>s administrationem cardinali <persName ref="p20596">Caraffę</persName> tradidisse sibi sola inquisitione retenta.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dicitur etiam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>20 cardinales de novo creare omnino <persName ref="p20596">Caraffam</persName> proximis cognationis gradibus contingentem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName>Croßmannus</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8442">Simler</persName> liest "Gössmanus".</note>, <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName> imperatoris consiliarius intimus, <placeName ref="l522">Venetias</placeName> transiit <placeName ref="l425">Romam</placeName> petiturus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et papę ex iussu sui domini indicaturus, ut concilium generale celebrandum curet, quod nisi <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>fiat, nationale ab aliis indictum iri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l2510">Turcica</placeName> classis 90 navium, quas galeas vocant, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>10. aprilis <placeName ref="l1148">Constantinopoli</placeName> solvit, quam 40 naves alię secuturę dicuntur, <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>petitura; sed quo in loco appellere constituerit, incertum est.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l2589">Picardia</placeName> conveniunt ex <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>parte <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> cardinalis <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingię</placeName> cum aliis, ex parte regis <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> episcopus <placeName ref="l2165">Atrebatensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>cum suis de pace inter utrosque reges ineunda tractaturi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Maximus est <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> apparatus <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>(ut dixi), qualis nunquam fuit; licet equites, qui <placeName>Rhenum</placeName>, ut dixi, trasierunt, adhuc ibi <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>hęreant, res agitur multis suspicua.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l1030">Wirtzburgensi</placeName> episcopo nobilis <persName ref="p20597">Guilielmus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>a Grumpach</persName>, qui expeditioni, quae satis magna esse dicitur, in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> adhuc existenti <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sese immiscet, bellum indixit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Confoederati <placeName>Landgrafenses</placeName>, qui iam <placeName>Landspergi</placeName> conventum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>agunt, habebunt, quod agant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hęc tuę humanitati significare et literas, quas <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>studioso <placeName ref="l18">Augustano</placeName> <placeName ref="l28">Basilęam</placeName> petituro tradidi, cum illum nondum abiisse intelligerem, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>addere volui.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Aufgeklebter Zettel ohne Datum etc.; Dem Brief vom 27. Juli 1564 aufgeklebt, aber nicht zu ihm gehörig. Vgl. <persName ref="p3740">Georg von Stetten</persName> an HB 30. April 1559.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
